chunk: passed over, a file that is not text: del.txt
chunk: passed over, a file that is not text: esc.sh
chunk: passed over, a file that is not text: cut.md
chunk: passed over, a path that build does not take or that leaves the directory: ../lib/a.aiw
chunk: passed over, a path that build does not take or that leaves the directory: lib/a.aiw
chunk: passed over, a path that build does not take or that leaves the directory: /etc/a.md
--- status 0
--- meta.tsv
notes.txt	1	1	text
--- text.jsonl
"a note"

