--- status 0
--- meta.tsv
most.txt	1	1	text

# PDF files: a chunk has the number of its page; pages and files that cannot be read
$ chunk . meta.tsv text.jsonl < list.txt
--- stdout
3 files, 7 chunks
--- stderr
chunk: passed over, the page 2 with a filter that is not known: mid.pdf
chunk: passed over, the page 3 that cannot be read: mid.pdf
chunk: passed over, an encrypted PDF file: locked.pdf
chunk: passed over, a PDF file that cannot be read: broken.pdf
chunk: passed over, a PDF file that costs more than it may: spent.pdf
chunk: passed over, a file that is no PDF file: fake.pdf
chunk: passed over, a PDF file whose name does not end in .pdf: named.txt
chunk: passed over, a PDF file with no text: empty.pdf
--- status 0
--- meta.tsv
two.pdf	1	1	pdf
two.pdf	2	2	pdf
Wide.PDF	1	1	pdf
Wide.PDF	1	1	pdf
Wide.PDF	1	1	pdf
mid.pdf	1	1	pdf
mid.pdf	4	4	pdf
--- text.jsonl
"The first page.\u000aIts second line."
"The second page."
""
"wwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwww"
"end"
"before"
"after"

